  "title": "[#17212] Define loading order for lua plugins",
  "description": "Instead of loading lua plugins in the random-seeming order that is returned by the filesystem, sort the list of plugin filenames in ASCIIbetical order. This makes the load order of plugins predictable.\n\nThis particular order was chosen to be consistent with the precedent setby various \\*nix tools.\n\nCloses #17212",
